OL,3,ABeauty advent calendars can cost
OL,4,Ahundreds - but are they value for
OL,5,Amoney?
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's easy to see the appeal of a beauty
OL,8,Fadvent calendar. Like many women at
OL,9,Fthis time of year, Julia says she often
OL,10,Ffinds herself tempted to splurge on one
OL,11,F- especially a perfume calendar. But
OL,12,Fshe takes quite an unsentimental
OL,13,Fapproach.
OL,15,F"I always look at what's in them. If I
OL,16,Flike enough of the fragrances, I'll buy
OL,17,Fit," says the 39-year old, who works as
OL,18,Fa senior commercial manager in
OL,19,Fengineering.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
