OL,3,ABeauty advent calendars can cost
OL,4,Ahundreds - but are they value for
OL,5,Amoney?
OL,6,
OL,7,FLuxury advent calendars are supposed to
OL,8,Foffer the thrill of a surprise but, for
OL,9,FJulia, it is more important she
OL,10,Factually wants the items inside - a
OL,11,Fthought that is also striking more and
OL,12,Fmore customers in the wake of the
OL,13,Fscandal over the Skims calendar.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
