OL,3,ABeauty advent calendars can cost
OL,4,Ahundreds - but are they value for
OL,5,Amoney?
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis week, Kim Kardashian's beauty
OL,8,Fbrand offered all of its customers
OL,9,Frefunds for its $148 (#110) calendar
OL,10,Fafter being widely criticised on social
OL,11,Fmedia over the quality of its contents,
OL,12,Fwith some customers likening the hair
OL,13,Fclips, scrunchies and keychains inside
OL,14,Fto things you might find down the back
OL,15,Fof a sofa.
